! So beautiful ❤️❤️\n\nWould you be willing to draw my VTube character? My character is a shut-in who is trapped in an online theme park, and he is forced to perform endlessly to viewers online. If he does not impress his viewers, he is punished!\n\nI have left a video of the online theme park my character is trapped in in the references (theme_park.mp4 in the Reference URL). You may use this and the other pieces in the Reference URL to guide you for details you can add to the piece. Subsequently, you could do whatever you wanted with the piece and its mood! You can be as experimental or creative with the color, design, and framing as you want.\n\nYou are the master. Being able to request you is an honor. I leave the rest to you. 💗\n\nI will share this on my SNS (Twitch, Twitter) with proper credit!\n\nFeel free to be as experimental as you want with this! Have a lot of fun!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CZ9HEl6d0fglUStNCU-pN01vWVybeOKp", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}